{"unit_id": "tag:023Y:proof", "translation": "我们略去（1）的证明，但指出，态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>就是态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，这里使用注<REF_0001>引入的记号（notation）。对于（2），我们指出哪个态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>给出函子性的（functorial）同构（isomorphism）。具体地，由于<MATH_0004>与<MATH_0005>都符合该交换图（commutative diagram），可见存在唯一的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>，满足<MATH_0007>。于是我们取<MATH_0008>。我们略去这一构造可行的验证。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "同构的构造，待决。"}, {"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "所引记号，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的", "context": "构造的自然性，待决。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "两函子之间的同构，待决。"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "确定唯一态射，待决。"}], "notes": ["remark：英文省略（1）的证明及末尾验证；保持省略，不补证明。"]}
