{"unit_id": "tag:02VT:statement", "translation": "取<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>、<MATH_0004>与<MATH_0005>如引理<REF_0001>所述，该引理构造的函子（functor）<MATH_0006>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>拉回函子（pullback functor）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，作用在下降（descent）数据（data）上。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "pullback functor", "target_term": "拉回函子"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "所构造函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "pullback functor", "target_term": "拉回函子", "context": "定义名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "作用对象，待决。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "下降数据的数学名词，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023U:prose-0006", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n若<MATH_0001>与<MATH_0002>有相同的目标<MATH_0003>，且<MATH_0004>加细（refines）<MATH_0005>（见《景（Sites）》定义<REF_0001>），但未给出明确的对<MATH_0006>，则仍可谈论拉回（pullback）函子（functor），因为我们已在引理<REF_0002>中看到，这一对的选择无关紧要（相差一个典范同构（canonical isomorphism））。\n\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "refines", "target_term": "加细"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "refines", "target_term": "加细", "context": "固定目标的族的加细，待决。"}, {"source_term": "Sites", "target_term": "景", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "函子的构造，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "选择无关的函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "选择无关的意义，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023Z:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>位于<MATH_0004>上，有<TEXTITOPEN_0001>平凡下降数据（trivial descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，属于<MATH_0005>且相对于<MATH_0006>，即<MATH_0007>上的恒等态射（identity morphism）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 由引理<REF_0001>，得到<TEXTITOPEN_0002>典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，位于<MATH_0008>上且相对于<MATH_0009>，其构造是沿<MATH_0010>拉回（pulling back）平凡下降数据（trivial descent datum）。我们常将<MATH_0011>用于表示这一下降（descent）数据（datum）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0012>相对于<MATH_0013>称为<TEXTITOPEN_0003>有效的（effective）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果<MATH_0014>同构（isomorphic）于典范下降数据（canonical descent datum）<MATH_0015>，其中<MATH_0016>为<MATH_0017>上的某个概形（scheme）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "trivial descent datum", "target_term": "平凡下降数据"}, {"source_term": "identity morphism", "target_term": "恒等态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical descent datum", "target_term": "典范下降数据"}, {"source_term": "pulling back", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "trivial descent datum", "target_term": "平凡下降数据"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "effective", "target_term": "有效的"}, {"source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "canonical descent datum", "target_term": "典范下降数据"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "底概形及下降对象，待决。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "概形态射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "相对态射，待决。"}, 